"Project-Id-Version: MUDRAVA Migration & Backup 1.1.0\n"
"Report-Msgid-Bugs-To: https://mudrava.com/en/\n"
"POT-Creation-Date: 2026-11-22 00:00+0000\n"
"PO-Revision-Date: 2026-11-22 00:00+0000\n"
"Last-Translator: MUDRAVA <info@mudrava.com>\n"
"Language-Team: Japanese <ja@li.org>\n"
"Language: ja\n"
"MIME-Version: 1.0\n"
